<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank allots 10.4 bln ats in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank allots 10.4 bln ats in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 10.4 billion schillings in one-week security repurchase agreements at a fixed three percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>It said 13 percent of the bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week the bank allotted 7.39 billion schillings in repos, or eight percent of the bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
